MID_MV14_00: <SH>
MID_MV14_00_m002: Non, Père ! Je vous en supplie, non !
MID_MV14_00_m003: (inhale/exhale x2)
MID_MV14_00_m004: Non !
MID_MV14_00_m005: Non ! Arrêtez !
MID_MV14_00_m006: C'est mon père !
MID_MV14_00_m007: Nooon ! Père !
MID_MV14_00_m008: (sobbing)
MID_MV14_00_m009: Amenez-moi la fille.
MID_MV14_00_m010: (gasp, followed by panicked/struggling exerts)
MID_MV14_00_m011: Je n'oublierai ni ton visage, ni ta voix...
MID_MV14_00_m012: Je te tuerai ! Je te TUERAI !
MID_MV14_00_m013: Je t'arracherai le cœur...
MID_MV14_00_m014: et je l'offrirai au dieu des Limbes !
MID_MV14_00_m015: (rushing in to attack)
MID_MV14_00_m016: (attack exert x2)
MID_MV14_00_m017: (damage exert)
MID_MV14_00_m018: (damage exert)
MID_MV14_00_m019: (labored breathing)
MID_MV14_00_m020: (grunt of effort)
MID_MV14_00_m021: Je vivrai... pour te voir mourir !
MID_MV14_00_m022: (labored breathing)
MID_MV14_00_m023: (slow exhale)
MID_MV14_00_m024: (slow exhale)
MID_MV14_00_m025: (slow exhale)